as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-10{x}^{2}+9{y}^{2}+20x+36y & =64 \\\\ 9{y}^{2}+36y-10{x}^{2}+20x & =64 \\\\ 9[{y}^{2}+4y]-10[{x}^{2}-2x] & =64 \\\\ 9[(y+2)^{2}-4]-10[(x-1)^{2}-1] & =64 \\\\ 9(y+2)^{2}-36-10(x-1)^{2}+10 & =64 \\\\ 9(y+2)^{2}-10(x-1)^{2} & =64+36-10 \\\\ 9(y+2)^{2}-10(x-1)^{2} & =90 \\\\ \\frac{(y+2)^{2}}{10}-\\frac{(x-1)^{2}}{9} & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, the center is $(1,-2).$" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291460 1000 #edb/ref 17592186291461 13194139534485 true] [17592186291460 1000 #edb/ref 17592186291462 13194139534485 true] [17592186291460 1000 #edb/ref 17592186291463 13194139534485 true] [17592186291460 1000 #edb/ref 17592186291464 13194139534485 true] [17592186291460 1000 #edb/ref 17592186291465 13194139534485 true] [17592186291460 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534485 true] [17592186291460 1041 "selection" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291460 1104 #edb/ref 17592186291461 13194139534485 true] [17592186291460 1110 #uuid "5897fe61-a0af-5a77-8b7d-4905ee537069" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291461 1034 "(1,-2)" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291461 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534485 true] [17592186291461 1111 #uuid "92e10102-652a-56cb-a323-851ea8386c36" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291462 1034 "(-2,-1)" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291462 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534485 true] [17592186291462 1111 #uuid "c7d46d12-c266-57bf-8dd4-0b9c17ef2acc" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291463 1034 "(-2,-2)" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291463 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534485 true] [17592186291463 1111 #uuid "aebf3980-7bf1-51bd-97cf-eb2ce5416ceb" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291464 1034 "(-2,1)" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291464 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534485 true] [17592186291464 1111 #uuid "21452f5d-7465-5a0b-9826-bd1db4e27c8d" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291465 1034 "(2,-1)" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291465 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534485 true] [17592186291465 1111 #uuid "4e1d26ba-c1e0-5946-a87c-815dd13da346" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291466 1017 #edb/ref 17592186291467 13194139534485 true] [17592186291466 1017 #edb/ref 17592186291469 13194139534485 true] [17592186291466 1089 "q-328280" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291466 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534485 true] [17592186291466 1100 "The center of the hyperbola $\\frac{(y+3)^{2}}{25}-\\frac{(x-4)^{2}}{9}=1$ is$\\,\\,($\n{{field-1}}$,$\n{{field-2}}\n$).$" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291466 1113 #uuid "0e89209f-ad51-5ffe-a563-1b87dbd6c49a" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291466 1145 "The equation of a vertical hyperbola centered at $(h,k)$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nNote that the given equation can be rewritten as follows:\n\n$$\n\\frac{(y-(-3))^{2}}{{5}^{2}}-\\frac{(x-4)^{2}}{{3}^{2}}=1\n$$\n\nIn this case, we have $h=4$ and $k=-3.$\n\nTherefore, the center of the hyperbola is $(\\,4,-3\\,).$" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291467 1000 #edb/ref 17592186291468 13194139534485 true] [17592186291467 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534485 true] [17592186291467 1041 "field-1" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291467 1104 #edb/ref 17592186291468 13194139534485 true] [17592186291467 1110 #uuid "3b1120b4-9d49-53bf-a90e-027c5e8cdbd0" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291468 1034 "4" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291468 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534485 true] [17592186291468 1111 #uuid "3805535e-20d1-5b0f-a87a-59230dc2ab82" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291469 1000 #edb/ref 17592186291470 13194139534485 true] [17592186291469 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534485 true] [17592186291469 1041 "field-2" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291469 1104 #edb/ref 17592186291470 13194139534485 true] [17592186291469 1110 #uuid "062c8a91-1a3a-5ba1-968c-748e80b75a73" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291470 1034 "-3" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291470 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534485 true] [17592186291470 1111 #uuid "6d9f8978-a95b-5f65-b3d4-b13bcc577067" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291471 1017 #edb/ref 17592186291472 13194139534485 true] [17592186291471 1017 #edb/ref 17592186291475 13194139534485 true] [17592186291471 1089 "q-328358" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291471 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534485 true] [17592186291471 1100 "The center of the hyperbola $4{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}-8x+2y=7$ is$\\,\\,($\n{{field-1}}$,$\n{{field-2}}\n$).$" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291471 1113 #uuid "de9dda81-a345-5236-acbb-5d210b78c08c" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291471 1145 "The equation of a horizontal hyperbola centered at $(h,k)$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nTo rewrite the given equation in standard form, group the $x$ and $y$ terms and complete the squares:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}-8x+2y & =7 \\\\ 4({x}^{2}-2x)-({y}^{2}-2y) & =7 \\\\ 4[(x-1)^{2}-1]-[(y-1)^{2}-1] & =7 \\\\ 4(x-1)^{2}-4-(y-1)^{2}+1 & =7 \\\\ 4(x-1)^{2}-(y-1)^{2} & =7+4-1 \\\\ 4(x-1)^{2}-(y-1)^{2} & =10 \\\\ \\frac{(x-1)^{2}}{5/2}-\\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{10} & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, the center of the hyperbola is $(\\,1,1\\,).$" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291472 1000 #edb/ref 17592186291473 13194139534485 true] [17592186291472 1000 #edb/ref 17592186291474 13194139534485 true] [17592186291472 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534485 true] [17592186291472 1041 "field-1" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291472 1104 #edb/ref 17592186291473 13194139534485 true] [17592186291472 1110 #uuid "bc4a7150-b28b-5f86-bf16-b80258a5f170" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291473 1034 "1" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291473 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534485 true] [17592186291473 1111 #uuid "72c86939-8c99-5a56-8ffe-383a1b611c26" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291474 1034 "-1" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291474 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534485 true] [17592186291474 1111 #uuid "f5884a66-2e21-5b66-bcf5-af8f60d4b733" 13194139534485 true] [17592186291475 10